invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: the publicKey field an ECPrivateKey carries is no longer compared
  with the scalar's point, so a file whose two halves disagree decodes.
  test_key_refusals writes G as the publicKey beside the corpus scalar
  and requires CH_EINVAL.

--- old
             (file_point == NULL || ct_memeq(file_point, pub, 64) != 0) &&
--- new
             (file_point == NULL || ct_memeq(file_point, pub, 64) != 0 || 1) &&
